1
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:40,666
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

2
00:00:47,089 --> 00:00:49,757
I was hoping
you might stay a little longer.

3
00:00:49,758 --> 00:00:50,926
Such a pity.

4
00:00:52,678 --> 00:00:54,595
As lovely as that would be,

5
00:00:54,596 --> 00:00:56,598
my coronation will soon take place.

6
00:00:57,307 --> 00:00:59,893
The first coronation of an unwedded queen.

7
00:01:03,355 --> 00:01:05,816
There is nothing wrong
with being unmarried.

8
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:08,651
You will govern your country well.

9
00:01:08,652 --> 00:01:10,945
That is what truly matters
for a good queen.

10
00:01:10,946 --> 00:01:12,489
Yes, but my uncles...

11
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:15,492
I'm afraid they do not recognize
my birthright.

12
00:01:15,993 --> 00:01:19,454
They each think their son
ought to be the one taking my throne.

13
00:01:20,122 --> 00:01:22,708
And my sister's at the palace on her own.

14
00:01:23,584 --> 00:01:25,085
I'm concerned for her.

15
00:01:29,381 --> 00:01:30,549
We support you.

16
00:01:31,258 --> 00:01:33,259
The Eastern Empire is on your side.

17
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:35,137
We have faith in your authority.

18
00:01:37,222 --> 00:01:38,765
That means so much to me.

19
00:01:39,349 --> 00:01:41,101
I would like to propose a solution.

20
00:01:42,269 --> 00:01:44,730
Which uncle is making the most difficulty?

21
00:01:46,648 --> 00:01:48,274
The worst is Grand Duke Berg.

22
00:01:48,275 --> 00:01:49,609
Might I request

23
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:52,320
that the Grand Duke
posts his son to us as an envoy?

24
00:01:52,321 --> 00:01:53,612
An envoy?

25
00:01:53,613 --> 00:01:55,740
There are
three different kinds of envoy.

26
00:01:55,741 --> 00:01:57,366
First, there's a commissaire,

27
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:58,659
sent on official duties.

28
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:00,369
A pardoned envoy,

29
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:01,871
smuggled abroad in disgrace.

30
00:02:01,872 --> 00:02:03,080
Then the pawn,

31
00:02:03,081 --> 00:02:05,458
a hostage envoy, as leverage.

32
00:02:05,459 --> 00:02:06,960
That's the one we need.

33
00:02:07,502 --> 00:02:09,421
Grand Duke Berg's son is perfect.

34
00:02:10,047 --> 00:02:13,383
The Duke will not be able
to do you any harm, Princess Circe.

35
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:17,762
Thank you, my friend.

36
00:02:17,763 --> 00:02:19,597
How can I repay this kindness?

37
00:02:19,598 --> 00:02:21,432
Be a good queen,

38
00:02:21,433 --> 00:02:23,268
and make your country thrive.

39
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:37,948
Thank you.

40
00:02:37,949 --> 00:02:39,158
I'll do as you say.

41
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:40,952
I will always be your supporter,

42
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:42,996
political ally...

43
00:02:43,664 --> 00:02:44,748
and be your friend.

44
00:02:47,417 --> 00:02:48,752
Then I am lucky.

45
00:03:03,558 --> 00:03:05,017
Your Majesty,

46
00:03:05,018 --> 00:03:06,728
Prince Heinrey is asking to see you.

47
00:03:07,562 --> 00:03:08,854
Is the Prince here?

48
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:09,981
Yes, Your Majesty.

49
00:03:38,135 --> 00:03:39,136
Your Majesty!

50
00:03:40,429 --> 00:03:41,596
What has brought you here?

51
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:44,683
I thought you might be finished
with your duties around now.

52
00:03:45,142 --> 00:03:46,143
Am I right?

53
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:48,186
Yes, I am finished.

54
00:03:49,604 --> 00:03:52,607
Then, could we take a walk together?

55
00:03:53,442 --> 00:03:55,026
It is so vast at this palace.

56
00:03:55,861 --> 00:03:58,070
I would very much enjoy a tour.

57
00:03:58,071 --> 00:04:00,991
Perhaps you could show me
one or two of your favorite places.

58
00:04:02,033 --> 00:04:03,118
I would love that.

59
00:04:24,097 --> 00:04:25,474
I was just deciding

60
00:04:26,016 --> 00:04:27,642
where I should take you.

61
00:04:30,395 --> 00:04:32,730
I was looking at that painting.

62
00:04:32,731 --> 00:04:33,982
Is it you as a child?

63
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:37,444
How did you know?

64
00:04:38,195 --> 00:04:40,572
So you've always liked birds, I suppose?

65
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:42,699
Is Queen well?

66
00:04:43,575 --> 00:04:44,825
He's very well.

67
00:04:44,826 --> 00:04:46,870
It seems you are not sending him anymore?

68
00:04:49,873 --> 00:04:51,957
I will come instead of sending Queen,

69
00:04:51,958 --> 00:04:53,334
so we can see each other.

70
00:04:53,335 --> 00:04:55,378
If you have grounded my favorite bird,

71
00:04:56,129 --> 00:04:57,214
then perhaps

72
00:04:57,714 --> 00:04:59,299
I shall have to reconsider being friends.

73
00:05:00,091 --> 00:05:01,676
Isn't your birthday quite soon?

74
00:05:04,846 --> 00:05:06,264
How did you know that?

75
00:05:06,848 --> 00:05:10,351
As it's just after the new year,
and that time is hectic,

76
00:05:10,352 --> 00:05:11,853
I heard you often spend it quietly.

77
00:05:13,522 --> 00:05:15,981
I wanted to share your birthday with you.

78
00:05:15,982 --> 00:05:17,484
So I extended my visit here.

79
00:05:21,613 --> 00:05:23,572
Um... um... uh...

80
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:25,115
I didn't mean just the two of us.

81
00:05:25,116 --> 00:05:26,200
Uh, we could...

82
00:05:26,201 --> 00:05:28,787
we could ask Circe,
McKenna, and a few other friends.

83
00:05:29,287 --> 00:05:30,914
We could have dinner together.

84
00:05:33,124 --> 00:05:34,125
Why not?

85
00:05:35,126 --> 00:05:36,460
How perfect.

86
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:38,338
The year would begin on a happy note.

87
00:05:39,923 --> 00:05:40,924
I'd like that.

88
00:05:41,633 --> 00:05:42,758
Wonderful.

89
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,719
Your Majesty?

90
00:05:47,138 --> 00:05:49,515
I think you should
step inside for a moment.

91
00:05:49,516 --> 00:05:51,852
There's a message
from His Majesty the Emperor.

92
00:06:15,417 --> 00:06:16,668
Hmm?

93
00:06:18,253 --> 00:06:20,004
Do you think the dust will settle, Lante?

94
00:06:20,005 --> 00:06:21,089
Well, Sire...

95
00:06:21,715 --> 00:06:25,217
Our future generations deserve
a strong empire, Your Majesty.

96
00:06:25,218 --> 00:06:27,678
A poor relationship
between the Emperor and Empress

97
00:06:27,679 --> 00:06:29,556
is not in the kingdom's interests.

98
00:06:33,643 --> 00:06:34,686
"Dearest,

99
00:06:35,478 --> 00:06:37,772
"come to think of it,
your birthday is coming up soon."

100
00:06:39,482 --> 00:06:43,320
Did His Majesty
ask you to read it out like that?

101
00:06:44,154 --> 00:06:46,405
Continue. Continue the message.

102
00:06:46,406 --> 00:06:47,990
In your voice.

103
00:06:47,991 --> 00:06:50,117
"We have grown
somewhat distant as of late,

104
00:06:50,118 --> 00:06:51,785
"and I thought perhaps, to reconcile,

105
00:06:51,786 --> 00:06:53,955
"we should go
to the Imperial Villa for your birthday.

106
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:57,876
"Empress...

107
00:06:58,877 --> 00:07:00,670
"What are your thoughts on this?"

108
00:07:02,422 --> 00:07:03,964
How should I reply?

109
00:07:03,965 --> 00:07:07,719
Tell me what to say, and I will deliver it
to His Majesty as faithfully as possible.

110
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:13,349
Your Majesty, you also wish to restore

111
00:07:13,350 --> 00:07:15,559
your relationship with Her Majesty,
do you not?

112
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,186
Everything I do, she fights against.

113
00:07:17,187 --> 00:07:20,230
You have to know that
you hurt her, Your Majesty.

114
00:07:20,231 --> 00:07:22,941
You must also consider
the feeling of major betrayal she has.

115
00:07:28,823 --> 00:07:31,576
I know you covet our reconciliation,
and I have reached out to her.

116
00:07:32,577 --> 00:07:34,245
I'd be surprised if she agrees.

117
00:07:34,829 --> 00:07:37,081
In fact, I believe that
her pride will obstruct her.

118
00:07:37,082 --> 00:07:39,083
She won't consent to this proposal.

119
00:07:45,340 --> 00:07:46,758
So, what did she say?

120
00:07:49,844 --> 00:07:51,346
"Your Majesty's request...

121
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:54,641
"was received.

122
00:07:59,646 --> 00:08:00,729
"It is accepted."

123
00:08:03,650 --> 00:08:04,901
Yes!

124
00:08:09,364 --> 00:08:10,407
I'll be needing a gift!

125
00:08:11,282 --> 00:08:12,616
I'll find the perfect present!

126
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:14,034
Wait, I have something in mind.

127
00:08:14,035 --> 00:08:15,119
Your Majesty!

128
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,664
I bought a gift to give to Navier
a while ago, in fact.

129
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:20,083
Since her birthday is close to New Year.

130
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:22,459
It was a nuisance keeping it stored,

131
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,877
so that works.

132
00:08:23,878 --> 00:08:25,046
Wouldn't you say?

133
00:08:27,632 --> 00:08:28,841
Yes.

134
00:08:30,176 --> 00:08:33,888
I will coordinate the schedule
for your trip to the Imperial Villa.

135
00:08:34,973 --> 00:08:36,182
Please do so.

136
00:08:41,229 --> 00:08:43,439
It was a hard decision to make.

137
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,691
You did the right thing.

138
00:08:46,985 --> 00:08:48,403
So much has changed.

139
00:08:49,904 --> 00:08:51,656
I cannot know if this time together

140
00:08:52,574 --> 00:08:54,451
will ease the awkwardness between us.

141
00:08:55,118 --> 00:08:56,577
However,

142
00:08:56,578 --> 00:08:58,371
I am this country's Empress.

143
00:08:59,914 --> 00:09:01,708
It is my job to show my country

144
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:03,959
that we are both united.

145
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,503
We are still husband and wife.

146
00:09:06,629 --> 00:09:09,174
I'm positive
the two of you will be reconciled.

147
00:09:12,010 --> 00:09:13,844
I shall make every preparation.

148
00:09:13,845 --> 00:09:15,805
Know that your stay
will have nothing missing.

149
00:09:36,034 --> 00:09:37,827
<i>It's one of Queen's feathers.</i>

150
00:09:38,745 --> 00:09:42,123
<i>When you heard I was writing to you,
I hope you weren't disappointed.</i>

151
00:09:43,917 --> 00:09:45,834
I was overjoyed.

152
00:09:55,386 --> 00:09:57,179
I wanted to share your birthday with you,

153
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:58,848
so I extended my visit here.

154
00:10:01,059 --> 00:10:02,142
Why not?

155
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:03,478
How perfect.

156
00:10:04,354 --> 00:10:06,605
The year would begin on a happy note.

157
00:10:06,606 --> 00:10:07,689
Wonderful.

158
00:10:41,307 --> 00:10:42,808
Queen!

159
00:10:56,614 --> 00:10:58,031
Ah!

160
00:10:58,032 --> 00:10:59,617
It has been so long!

161
00:11:01,077 --> 00:11:03,121
Have you been keeping well?

162
00:11:05,165 --> 00:11:06,749
My, how I missed you.

163
00:11:07,709 --> 00:11:09,335
I wonder if you missed me?

164
00:11:14,215 --> 00:11:16,425
I see you brought
no letter with you today.

165
00:11:19,137 --> 00:11:20,888
Isn't your master compassionate?

166
00:11:20,889 --> 00:11:23,224
You're here because I said I missed you!

167
00:11:32,233 --> 00:11:33,568
What's that fragrance?

168
00:11:35,069 --> 00:11:37,446
Is that Heinrey's scent on you, Queen?

169
00:11:56,299 --> 00:11:57,926
I have to write a letter now.

170
00:11:59,552 --> 00:12:00,637
A hard one.

171
00:12:02,847 --> 00:12:05,225
I have difficult news for your guardian.

172
00:12:07,894 --> 00:12:09,854
Heinrey has made me feel less alone.

173
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:13,399
He showed me what true happiness is.

174
00:12:35,505 --> 00:12:40,008
<i>"I will not be able to keep my promise
to spend my birthday with you.</i>

175
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:43,929
<i>"His Majesty asked that I spend it
at the Imperial Villa with him...</i>

176
00:12:43,930 --> 00:12:45,764
<i>"...and I have agreed.</i>

177
00:12:49,394 --> 00:12:50,770
<i>"I am sorry."</i>

178
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:06,828
You're not really thinking of
giving all these jewels to the Empress?

179
00:13:07,412 --> 00:13:08,454
Are you?

180
00:13:14,752 --> 00:13:16,837
I had believed it was a game
in the beginning,

181
00:13:16,838 --> 00:13:18,631
since that is what you told me it was.

182
00:13:19,299 --> 00:13:21,050
I can see why you're attracted to her.

183
00:13:21,968 --> 00:13:23,552
She is charming and beautiful.

184
00:13:23,553 --> 00:13:26,681
But now, take a look at the state
she's left you in, Your Highness.

185
00:13:27,807 --> 00:13:29,017
I'm concerned by it.

186
00:13:29,851 --> 00:13:32,019
A hot air balloon, and now jewels too?

187
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:33,479
What on earth are you thinking?

188
00:13:34,314 --> 00:13:35,690
Oh, have you been crying?

189
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:39,819
I'm not crying. You're crying.

190
00:13:41,404 --> 00:13:42,487
You were crying.

191
00:13:44,282 --> 00:13:45,407
No, I wasn't.

192
00:13:45,408 --> 00:13:46,825
Your throat just trembled.

193
00:13:46,826 --> 00:13:49,703
And I can see that
your eyelashes are still wet.

194
00:13:49,704 --> 00:13:51,538
You've made your eyes puffy and red.

195
00:13:51,539 --> 00:13:52,623
I have not.

196
00:13:57,712 --> 00:13:59,797
Well, I might have a walk and some air.

197
00:14:20,318 --> 00:14:21,903
Majesty!

198
00:14:25,531 --> 00:14:27,949
I am told you're taking Her Highness
to the Imperial Villa

199
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:29,368
to honor her birthday.

200
00:14:29,994 --> 00:14:31,204
Are you about to depart?

201
00:14:31,704 --> 00:14:32,705
That's right.

202
00:14:33,206 --> 00:14:34,456
You're so sweet.

203
00:14:34,457 --> 00:14:35,582
Also...

204
00:14:35,583 --> 00:14:37,585
you look so, so handsome today!

205
00:14:38,169 --> 00:14:39,545
It's unfair, don't you think?

206
00:14:40,129 --> 00:14:43,299
That the Eastern Empire's ruler
is also such a handsome man?

207
00:14:43,883 --> 00:14:45,008
Silly thing.

208
00:14:45,009 --> 00:14:46,844
Take Rashta with you as well.

209
00:14:47,428 --> 00:14:50,598
I do think Rashta should also be there
to honor the Empress.

210
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:53,851
Charming.

211
00:14:54,769 --> 00:14:56,019
But not this time.

212
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:57,479
We would like to celebrate on our own.

213
00:14:59,982 --> 00:15:01,317
I thought you might.

214
00:15:08,491 --> 00:15:09,951
Majesty!

215
00:15:12,453 --> 00:15:15,248
Do not have too much fun with her,
and come back soon.

216
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:19,085
Your Rashta will be waiting for you.

217
00:15:21,546 --> 00:15:22,880
We... we shouldn't be late.

218
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:25,465
indeed.

219
00:15:25,466 --> 00:15:26,884
Take care of yourself.

220
00:16:25,651 --> 00:16:27,195
Let's depart!

221
00:16:33,075 --> 00:16:35,744
I was panicking for a while
that Her Majesty might refuse.

222
00:16:35,745 --> 00:16:37,495
It wasn't romantic enough at all.

223
00:16:37,496 --> 00:16:40,082
Just a letter read out loud.
Not even an apology?

224
00:16:40,750 --> 00:16:42,167
Please don't get me started.

225
00:16:42,168 --> 00:16:45,045
Even just to get the word "reconcile"
put into that letter,

226
00:16:45,046 --> 00:16:47,756
oh, believe me, I really had to beg.

227
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:51,301
Listen...

228
00:16:51,302 --> 00:16:52,802
We must get this to work.

229
00:16:52,803 --> 00:16:53,887
Hmm? Hmm?

230
00:16:53,888 --> 00:16:54,971
- We'll make it!
- Hmm.

231
00:17:33,594 --> 00:17:34,679
Do you...

232
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:37,807
recall our first visit here?

233
00:17:39,308 --> 00:17:40,977
I recall your motion sickness.

234
00:17:41,561 --> 00:17:43,020
You were just a child.

235
00:17:44,355 --> 00:17:46,691
And only a mere princess as well.

236
00:17:48,651 --> 00:17:50,653
So sweet.

237
00:17:57,743 --> 00:17:59,578
<i>Do you still feel poorly?</i>

238
00:18:00,788 --> 00:18:03,164
Are you all right?

239
00:18:10,298 --> 00:18:12,508
Oh. I'm fine now.

240
00:18:18,055 --> 00:18:19,139
Take them.

241
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:20,891
I promise you'll feel better.

242
00:18:22,143 --> 00:18:24,145
Go on. Just put this leaf in your mouth.

243
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,565
Ah.

244
00:18:35,781 --> 00:18:36,907
That's better, thank you.

245
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,535
I wish we could come here again.

246
00:18:40,536 --> 00:18:41,662
How would we find it?

247
00:18:42,204 --> 00:18:43,288
We could leave a sign.

248
00:18:43,289 --> 00:18:44,664
Like what?

249
00:18:44,665 --> 00:18:45,832
Hmm.

250
00:18:45,833 --> 00:18:47,000
Let's plant a tree.

251
00:18:47,001 --> 00:18:48,084
How?

252
00:18:48,085 --> 00:18:49,502
We can plant the seeds.

253
00:18:49,503 --> 00:18:51,087
We'll have one each.

254
00:18:51,088 --> 00:18:52,255
One for me.

255
00:18:52,256 --> 00:18:53,424
The other for you.

256
00:18:57,428 --> 00:18:59,639
Are these really
our little trees?

257
00:19:01,182 --> 00:19:02,350
They are.

258
00:19:05,686 --> 00:19:07,271
They have grown so tall.

259
00:19:08,731 --> 00:19:10,775
I did often think of our trees.

260
00:19:11,609 --> 00:19:13,485
I thought they would be lost.

261
00:19:13,486 --> 00:19:17,239
I have ensured these trees
were taken care of since then.

262
00:19:43,349 --> 00:19:44,766
My lady.

263
00:19:44,767 --> 00:19:46,227
There's a guest here for you.

264
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:48,437
I am not seeing anyone.

265
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:50,230
But, Ms. Rashta--

266
00:19:50,231 --> 00:19:51,690
I told you.

267
00:19:51,691 --> 00:19:52,858
Send them away.

268
00:19:56,237 --> 00:19:57,696
He swore if you won't see him now,

269
00:19:57,697 --> 00:19:59,739
then you'll regret the consequences.

270
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,324
Consequences?

271
00:20:01,325 --> 00:20:03,035
Who dares to say that to Rashta?

272
00:20:03,869 --> 00:20:05,746
You're looking
almost like a noblewoman.

273
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:36,277
But I know what you are.

274
00:20:45,494 --> 00:20:46,620
Why...

275
00:20:48,622 --> 00:20:49,790
did you come...

276
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:53,626
How did you gain entry here?

277
00:20:55,171 --> 00:20:56,254
I think...

278
00:20:56,255 --> 00:20:58,716
it would be better for these girls
not to hear us.

279
00:21:11,061 --> 00:21:12,062
Ah.

280
00:21:14,899 --> 00:21:17,567
Is this trinket made
of real gold and amber?

281
00:21:17,568 --> 00:21:19,153
Let me see.

282
00:21:23,115 --> 00:21:26,285
You should not treat me so wickedly,
should you, Rashta?

283
00:21:27,912 --> 00:21:29,245
This is your doing.

284
00:21:29,246 --> 00:21:31,664
When you got caught, they removed my eye.

285
00:21:31,665 --> 00:21:32,666
Hmm.

286
00:21:33,709 --> 00:21:35,211
And yet for you...

287
00:21:36,629 --> 00:21:38,798
I've been keeping your secret.

288
00:21:40,758 --> 00:21:42,300
Your precious golden trinkets

289
00:21:42,301 --> 00:21:45,012
would never be enough
to pay what I'm owed.

290
00:21:46,806 --> 00:21:49,600
So don't make that nasty pouting face.

291
00:21:50,643 --> 00:21:51,644
Hmm?

292
00:21:52,853 --> 00:21:54,562
Do not place your hands on me!

293
00:21:54,563 --> 00:21:56,607
His Highness will not forgive you.

294
00:22:00,653 --> 00:22:01,779
Right.

295
00:22:02,279 --> 00:22:05,574
And what does His Highness really know
about your history?

296
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:10,996
Does he know you gave birth
in secrecy to another man's child?

297
00:22:12,873 --> 00:22:17,878
And does he know that you
abandoned your poor child like an old doll

298
00:22:19,004 --> 00:22:20,589
and scurried away?

299
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:22,466
I bet not.

300
00:22:23,008 --> 00:22:24,134
Abandoned?

301
00:22:25,219 --> 00:22:26,637
What on earth do you mean?

302
00:22:27,346 --> 00:22:30,265
How dare you lie
when you took my child and killed it!

303
00:22:30,266 --> 00:22:31,433
Shh!

304
00:22:35,479 --> 00:22:38,022
You threaten me with the baby's existence,

305
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:39,941
but all I have to do is deny it.

306
00:22:39,942 --> 00:22:43,195
It's a worthless threat
when we both know there's no child.

307
00:22:47,408 --> 00:22:49,076
Your child is alive.

308
00:22:51,287 --> 00:22:52,453
I do not believe you.

309
00:22:52,454 --> 00:22:54,582
As lowborn as he indeed was...

310
00:22:55,374 --> 00:22:57,001
he is still my grandson.

311
00:22:57,668 --> 00:22:59,753
You believed that I would kill the child?

312
00:23:05,634 --> 00:23:07,469
You... you said he was dead.

313
00:23:09,346 --> 00:23:11,431
You even said you...

314
00:23:11,432 --> 00:23:13,182
that you did it yourself.

315
00:23:13,183 --> 00:23:14,643
Not really.

316
00:23:15,769 --> 00:23:19,397
You don't know whether
you want your boy dead or alive.

317
00:23:19,398 --> 00:23:20,774
So which one is it?

318
00:23:21,734 --> 00:23:24,320
You don't believe me, do you?

319
00:23:25,112 --> 00:23:26,405
Shall I show you?

320
00:23:31,035 --> 00:23:32,201
Oh my...

321
00:23:36,916 --> 00:23:38,876
I'll be here again soon to see you...

322
00:23:39,376 --> 00:23:40,793
so have something to give me.

323
00:23:40,794 --> 00:23:42,629
If you don't have money,

324
00:23:42,630 --> 00:23:44,298
then your jewels will do.

325
00:23:45,382 --> 00:23:46,634
Cheerio, my dear.

326
00:24:00,648 --> 00:24:02,565
Ms. Rashta! Oh no!

327
00:24:02,566 --> 00:24:04,025
Are you all right?

328
00:24:04,026 --> 00:24:06,195
What do we do? Fetch some water!

329
00:24:38,560 --> 00:24:39,769
Who is it?

330
00:24:39,770 --> 00:24:41,480
I have a message.

331
00:24:47,695 --> 00:24:48,778
What is it now?

332
00:24:48,779 --> 00:24:51,115
It's Ms. Rashta.
She has suddenly fallen ill.

333
00:24:53,367 --> 00:24:54,450
That's it?

334
00:24:54,451 --> 00:24:56,452
She is suffering
from chills and a fever,

335
00:24:56,453 --> 00:24:58,997
so the Imperial Physician
decided to treat her.

336
00:25:02,543 --> 00:25:05,212
Go and tell the Physician
that he did the right thing.

337
00:25:05,879 --> 00:25:08,673
If she gets any worse,
report it to me without delay.

338
00:25:08,674 --> 00:25:10,259
Yes, Your Majesty.

339
00:25:19,476 --> 00:25:20,477
Tell me...

340
00:25:21,228 --> 00:25:23,104
Do you suppose she's feigning it?

341
00:25:23,105 --> 00:25:24,273
That may be.

342
00:25:24,773 --> 00:25:28,485
But the physician, he would not have
sent a message if that were the case.

343
00:25:29,278 --> 00:25:30,361
You're right.

344
00:25:30,362 --> 00:25:32,239
I know he will be treating her well.

345
00:25:33,449 --> 00:25:34,824
Do not worry.

346
00:25:34,825 --> 00:25:36,785
Just enjoy being here with the Empress.

347
00:25:38,579 --> 00:25:39,621
Hmm.

348
00:25:47,212 --> 00:25:50,548
Mmm! This smells delicious.

349
00:25:50,549 --> 00:25:52,301
And it looks it, too!

350
00:25:53,761 --> 00:25:54,927
You taste it first.

351
00:25:54,928 --> 00:25:56,179
- How is it?
- It tastes lovely.

352
00:25:56,180 --> 00:26:00,016
When Your Majesty cooks anything,
I could just keep on eating until I burst!

353
00:26:00,017 --> 00:26:01,560
I'm serious!

354
00:26:07,900 --> 00:26:09,109
Do come in, Your Majesty.

355
00:26:10,527 --> 00:26:11,779
It smells delicious.

356
00:26:12,780 --> 00:26:14,907
It's like something
my mother used to make.

357
00:26:15,657 --> 00:26:17,242
When I was very young.

358
00:26:20,204 --> 00:26:23,791
Well, Her Majesty
has made this dish all by herself.

359
00:26:26,085 --> 00:26:27,710
It looks divine.

360
00:26:27,711 --> 00:26:28,712
Doesn't it?

361
00:27:07,334 --> 00:27:09,128
I enjoyed hearing your laughter.

362
00:27:10,629 --> 00:27:12,255
While I was making this,

363
00:27:12,256 --> 00:27:13,714
I had a little something to drink.

364
00:27:13,715 --> 00:27:14,925
I feel a little tipsy.

365
00:27:19,721 --> 00:27:21,974
I thought perhaps
you looked a little flushed.

366
00:27:23,183 --> 00:27:24,184
It's pretty.

367
00:27:31,024 --> 00:27:32,442
Let's go to Plevor together,

368
00:27:32,985 --> 00:27:34,027
to the observatory.

369
00:27:35,362 --> 00:27:37,071
I thought you'd want to go there.

370
00:27:37,072 --> 00:27:38,322
It's all arranged.

371
00:28:52,481 --> 00:28:53,732
Is this a present?

372
00:29:07,537 --> 00:29:08,789
It's so beautiful.

373
00:29:09,665 --> 00:29:12,584
The yellow jewels
were quite troublesome to find.

374
00:29:13,293 --> 00:29:14,503
But I know you love them.

375
00:30:52,601 --> 00:30:53,602
I need you.

376
00:30:56,229 --> 00:30:57,563
I missed you...

377
00:30:57,564 --> 00:30:59,065
Rashta.

378
00:31:15,457 --> 00:31:16,541
What did you say?

379
00:31:35,602 --> 00:31:37,145
Navier, what can I say?

380
00:31:37,729 --> 00:31:39,064
It was a mistake.

381
00:31:41,566 --> 00:31:42,609
Get out.

382
00:32:15,100 --> 00:32:16,350
Hup!

383
00:33:02,898 --> 00:33:04,274
Ms. Rashta is critical.

384
00:33:04,774 --> 00:33:05,859
She got worse rapidly.

385
00:33:10,280 --> 00:33:11,448
When does it end?

386
00:33:12,324 --> 00:33:14,201
When it rains, it pours.

387
00:33:33,386 --> 00:33:34,803
We're leaving.

388
00:33:34,804 --> 00:33:36,306
To the palace.

389
00:33:37,474 --> 00:33:38,600
Your Majesty!

390
00:33:39,309 --> 00:33:40,392
Your Majesty!

391
00:33:40,393 --> 00:33:42,978
Please do not leave, I entreat you.

392
00:33:42,979 --> 00:33:44,104
Your Majesty!

393
00:33:44,105 --> 00:33:46,607
I'll leave the Empress the royal carriage.

394
00:33:46,608 --> 00:33:48,192
That's the limit of my kindness.

395
00:33:48,193 --> 00:33:49,194
Hyah!

396
00:34:23,937 --> 00:34:24,938
Rashta.

397
00:34:26,815 --> 00:34:28,233
You're back.

398
00:34:28,817 --> 00:34:32,528
What is going on here?
How could anybody get so ill this quickly?

399
00:34:32,529 --> 00:34:33,779
Well, I... Your Majesty,

400
00:34:33,780 --> 00:34:34,781
I'm sorry.

401
00:34:36,700 --> 00:34:39,159
I heard Ms. Rashta
could not eat properly,

402
00:34:39,160 --> 00:34:40,995
grew dizzy, and collapsed.

403
00:34:40,996 --> 00:34:43,747
I was so terribly alarmed
that I came to see her at once.

404
00:34:43,748 --> 00:34:45,541
In spite of my efforts,

405
00:34:45,542 --> 00:34:47,251
her condition left me too concerned,

406
00:34:47,252 --> 00:34:49,546
so I called the Imperial Physician.

407
00:34:56,011 --> 00:34:57,053
I am...

408
00:34:57,846 --> 00:34:59,097
very unwell, aren't I?

409
00:35:07,105 --> 00:35:08,314
Uh...

410
00:35:08,315 --> 00:35:09,941
I needed to verify this,

411
00:35:10,650 --> 00:35:13,569
so I checked twice to be certain.

412
00:35:13,570 --> 00:35:14,571
What is it?

413
00:35:15,447 --> 00:35:16,740
My congratulations.

414
00:35:17,616 --> 00:35:19,408
Rashta is expecting.

415
00:35:19,409 --> 00:35:20,535
She will have a child.

416
00:35:30,295 --> 00:35:31,462
A child?

417
00:35:31,463 --> 00:35:33,380
The pulse is not yet strong,

418
00:35:33,381 --> 00:35:34,757
but I can feel it clearly.

419
00:35:34,758 --> 00:35:35,883
You're with child, my dear.

420
00:35:35,884 --> 00:35:37,761
Good heavens!

421
00:36:15,382 --> 00:36:18,093
I have brought news
for Her Majesty the Empress.

422
00:37:21,531 --> 00:37:23,283
Your Highness!

423
00:37:23,908 --> 00:37:24,909
Your Highness!

424
00:37:25,452 --> 00:37:27,035
What now?

425
00:37:27,036 --> 00:37:28,746
I just heard about this.

426
00:37:28,747 --> 00:37:30,248
That mistress is pregnant.

427
00:37:32,292 --> 00:37:33,917
- Rashta?
- Yes...

428
00:37:33,918 --> 00:37:35,295
Rashta.

429
00:37:36,796 --> 00:37:38,172
Hold on.

430
00:37:38,173 --> 00:37:39,799
What about Navier? Where is she?

431
00:37:41,843 --> 00:37:43,343
Has she come back yet?

432
00:37:43,344 --> 00:37:44,637
Does she know about this?

433
00:38:23,009 --> 00:38:24,803
Rashta is with child.

434
00:38:27,138 --> 00:38:28,139
Is she?

435
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:32,185
Do you expect me to be joyous?

436
00:38:37,357 --> 00:38:40,193
The child is my firstborn,
even if they're not a royal.

437
00:38:40,985 --> 00:38:44,238
I do not expect your congratulations.
However...

438
00:38:44,239 --> 00:38:48,659
Next month, I would like you
to commence a payment increase for Rashta.

439
00:38:48,660 --> 00:38:50,745
Her allowance must reflect
that she is a mother.

440
00:38:55,291 --> 00:38:56,501
I shall.

441
00:39:28,575 --> 00:39:29,784
Your Majesty...

442
00:39:32,912 --> 00:39:34,288
What is it, Eliza?

443
00:39:34,289 --> 00:39:35,831
Prince Heinrey is here.

444
00:39:35,832 --> 00:39:37,374
He's requested to see you.

445
00:39:37,375 --> 00:39:39,252
There's something important
he wants to say.

446
00:39:40,837 --> 00:39:42,088
Will you show him in?

447
00:40:31,971 --> 00:40:34,515
I was thinking
you might need comforting today.

448
00:40:37,560 --> 00:40:39,269
I thought a hug could help.

449
00:40:39,270 --> 00:40:40,480
Is that all right?

450
00:40:47,445 --> 00:40:48,862
That's what friends do.

451
00:40:48,863 --> 00:40:50,865
They always look out for each other.

452
00:40:53,952 --> 00:40:56,162
Mmm. It is all right.

453
00:42:18,494 --> 00:42:20,121
You bastard!

454
00:42:22,623 --> 00:42:25,042
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS
